# Database / Drizzle Conventions

Persistence rules and index guidance: [`docs/golden-file-pattern.md`](../../docs/golden-file-pattern.md) (Persistence Layer).

## Schema patterns

```typescript
export const agencyOpsClient = pgTable(
  "agency_ops_client",
  {
    id: text("id").primaryKey(),                    // prefixed IDs via createWorkspaceId()
    teamId: text("team_id")
      .notNull()
      .references(() => workspaceTeam.id, { onDelete: "cascade" }),
    createdAt: timestamp("created_at").defaultNow().notNull(),
    updatedAt: timestamp("updated_at")
      .defaultNow()
      .$onUpdate(() => new Date())
      .notNull(),
  },
  (table) => [
    index("agency_ops_client_team_idx").on(table.teamId),
  ],
);
```

## Naming

- Postgres: `snake_case` tables/columns with domain prefixes (`agency_ops_*`, `workspace_*`)
- TypeScript exports: `camelCase` (`agencyOpsClient`)
- Indexes: `{table}_{columns}_idx`
- Enums: `$type<Union>()` on text columns

## Workflow

| Environment | Command |
|-------------|---------|
| Local dev | `bun run db:push` |
| Committed migrations | `bun run db:generate` → `bun run db:migrate` |

Export new tables from `packages/db/src/schema/index.ts`.

## Query patterns

No repository layer — query directly in `packages/api/src/routers/*/service.ts`:

```typescript
import { db } from "@orch/db";
import { agencyOpsClient } from "@orch/db/schema";
```
